# src/packages/control-ui/src/locales

## Purpose
Owns Control UI localization resources and locale organization used to present translated user-facing copy.

## Contents
Contains locale data and seed/reference translation material organized for the frontend localization pipeline.

## Interfaces and dependencies
Consumed by the Control UI internationalization layer and build tooling; keys correspond to user-facing strings referenced by application code.

## Invariants
Locale keys remain structurally compatible across supported languages, placeholders are preserved exactly, encoding is UTF-8, and seed/reference data does not silently override the canonical runtime locale source.